The existing harness extension parses, passes scoped ESLint and successfully executes its actual esbuild `bundle()` function with generated production CSS. **No browser was launched. No new or existing browser check was executed in this batch, and no screenshot, computed-mode observation or UI pass is claimed.** The previous browser evidence remains historical and separate.

